  "details": "VRChat users who go to conventions have gotten pretty crafty with making laminated VRC badges for themselves. When going to purchase one of these badges, it should allow you to customize the following:\n\n-Size of the badge (Small, medium or large)\n\n-Username\n\n-Nameplate status\n\n-Online status\n\n-VRChat Plus icon\n\n-Group banner\n\n-Trust rank (maybe the exception of Nuisance!)\n\n-Avatar performance\n\nThe end product should result in a laminated badge to wear on a clip or lanyard :)",
